    rdfs:comment "Real pack at ~/clap-noun-verb/packs/clap-noun-verb-capability-pack, verified 2026-09-11: `find gates -iname '*.rq'` returns exactly gates/capability-crown.rq (count 1); `find templates` returns exactly 3 .tera files; `find queries` returns exactly 1 .rq file (capability-catalog.rq); the ontology.ttl there declares 21 cnv:-namespaced individuals." .

